            "notes": "### **\u2728 Aren't you glad you have me? \u2728**\n\n___________________________\n\n### \u2694\ufe0f ITEMS\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f Make sure to get the items marked with \u2728 first.\n\n| Item | Description |\n| ---- | ------------ |\n| [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) | \u2728 This is one of [Mercy](hero_0e213bfc-3ca9-49c6-9036-e7f344b752da)'s best **survivability** items. You will get healed simply by using Guardian Angel |\n| [Angelic Acrobatics](item_baad85fc-3da5-43af-ad9d-f17885f59aa5) | \u2728 **S18 PATCH ADDED [Ability Power](stat_ability_power)**. Synergizes with [The Whambulance](item_67e91029-d0fc-4c9d-9733-ec7e1cc064a9) and [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8), both Guardian Angel dependent |\n| [Blessed Boosters](item_957fd380-b7b4-40d4-8333-bb8c535ca931) | This will give you distance to heal from further to maximise your healing from [The Whambulance](item_67e91029-d0fc-4c9d-9733-ec7e1cc064a9), as well as amazing survivability |\n| [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) | Burst of healing from your Staff as soon as you use Guardian Angel, which will boost your Staff's healing output altogether |\n| [Long Distance Wings](item_8b4bafad-c8bc-4c77-bbe7-798b03920c88) | \u2728 Synergizes with [The Whambulance](item_67e91029-d0fc-4c9d-9733-ec7e1cc064a9) by allowing you to fly from further away to heal a greater amount |\n\n### \ud83d\udcb0 Under $45k? \nYou can choose between the following purple items based on your needs:\n- [Blessed Boosters](item_957fd380-b7b4-40d4-8333-bb8c535ca931) for better survivability (along with [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) \n- [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) for higher healing output from your Staff\n\n#### Optional items:\n- [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) \n- [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) \n- [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) \n- [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0)",
